[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5257254184","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122314#issuecomment-5257254184","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122314","id":5257254184,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOVtVKA","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-11T18:31:36Z","updated_at":"2026-08-11T19:56:05Z","body":"Brainstorming solutions:\n```\nclass SafeError {\n\tError value;\n\npublic:\n\t// Delete the implicit conversion to bool to trigger a compiler error.\n\toperator bool() const = delete;\n\n\t// Allow it to still act like a normal Error enum everywhere else.\n\t_ALWAYS_INLINE_ operator Error() const { return value; }\n\n\t_ALWAYS_INLINE_ SafeError(Error p_value) :\n\t\t\tvalue(p_value) {}\n};\n```\nAnd return `SafeError` from functions instead of `Error`?\n\nUPDATE: This works nicely, the only downside is code churn.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5257254184/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5257520640","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122314#issuecomment-5257520640","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122314","id":5257520640,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOV9mAA","user":{"login":"hpvb","id":2591099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTEwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2591099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb","html_url":"https://github.com/hpvb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-11T18:57:04Z","updated_at":"2026-08-11T18:57:04Z","body":"I'd rather add an `operator bool(Error)` instead of adding another struct just for errors. Also we have enough `Safe` stuff :P","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5257520640/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5258008421","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122314#issuecomment-5258008421","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122314","id":5258008421,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOWbXZQ","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-11T19:44:07Z","updated_at":"2026-08-11T19:44:07Z","body":"I had no joy with that (pity, as it would avoid code churn), unfortunately afaik `operator bool(Error)` type global functions won't compile in c++:\n\nhttps://en.cppreference.com/cpp/language/cast_operator\n\nalso:\n\nAccording to the C++ Standard, an unscoped enum automatically converts to its underlying integer type, which then has a standard conversion to bool.\n\n```\nenum Error { OK, ERR_FAIL };\n\n// COMPILATION ERROR: \"operator bool\" must be a non-static member function\nbool operator bool(Error e) { \n    return e != OK; \n}\n```\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5258008421/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5271228406","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122314#issuecomment-5271228406","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122314","id":5271228406,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOjCP9g","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-12T18:43:19Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T18:45:28Z","body":"I've had a bit more of a look at using an `enum class`, after @Repiteo suggested trying `constexpr` to get them into the global namespace in the core meeting today (and @Shadows-of-Fire on rocket chat).\n\nIt's possible to change `Error` to an `enum class`, then hoist the enum into the global namespace like so:\n\n```\nconstexpr Error OK = Error::OK;\nconstexpr Error FAILED = Error::FAILED;\nconstexpr Error ERR_UNAVAILABLE = Error::ERR_UNAVAILABLE;\n```\nThis works for quite a bit then fails the bindings.\nHowever it is possible to change the bindings to work with an `enum class` (like `enum`), and I have a proof of concept working.\n\nThe next problem that crops up which may be the breaker .. implicit conversion to `bool` (and integers) is used quite liberally throughout Godot 3.x (and I presume 4.x too).\n\nI've been playing global replace and whack a mole to change these but there is a lot of churn, and I'm worried that this will be breaking for third party modules. So the `enum class` may not pan out and I'm going back to thinking the targetted approach in #122325 or similar will be more appropriate.\n\nWill also be interested if @hpvb or anyone else has anymore ideas / proof of concepts. 👍 ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5271228406/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5719129402","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122314#issuecomment-5719129402","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122314","id":5719129402,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVOL9Og","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-17T18:14:07Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T18:14:07Z","body":"Fixed (for now) by #122325.\nWe may revisit this further with a more elaborate solution at some point.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5719129402/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]